 "words": 358,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "From Gerar the king rides out to the field",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With Phicol, the commander, standing by",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He speaks to the patriarch, voice low and mild",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God is with you in everything you do, he said",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Swear to me here by the God of high heaven",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That you will not deal falsely with my line",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will show you kindness, as you have shown me",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the land where you have stayed as a stranger",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Phicol the commander of the army stands",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Witness to the oath, the covenant in hands",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Seven ewe lambs set apart from the flock",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Accept these as my witness that I dug this well",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.06,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Abraham takes sheep and cattle to give",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The two of them make a covenant of peace",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He sets apart seven ewe lambs to live",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As proof that he dug the well in this place",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The place is called Beersheba, they swear",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When they had made the covenant at Beersheba",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Abimelech and Phicol the commander set out",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Returned to the land of the Philistines, true",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Phicol the commander of the army stands",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Witness to the oath, the covenant in hands",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Seven ewe lambs set apart from the flock",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Accept these as my witness that I dug this well",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Years pass and Isaac lives in the same land",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Abimelech comes again from the city gate",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With Ahuzzath the adviser, and Phicol in hand",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They saw clearly that the Lord was with you, said they",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Isaac asks why they have come to his door",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Since they hated him and sent him away from you",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They seek a sworn agreement, peace between us",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Just as we did you nothing but good and sent you away",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Phicol the commander of the army stands",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Witness to the oath, the covenant in hands",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Seven ewe lambs set apart from the flock",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Accept these as my witness that I dug this well",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.07,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He makes them a feast, they eat and drink",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Early in the morning they rise and swear",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Exchanging oaths with one another, plain",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then Isaac sends them off, they leave him in peace",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Phicol the commander of the army stands",
   "heard": 6,
